    "title": "Silo super slugger headed to Murray State - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Ogburn, KTEN Sports ,\n1 hours ago SILO, Oklahoma (KTEN)- Silo super slugger Connie Tubby is taking her bat just down the road to join the Murray State College softball program. She signed with the Aggies on Wednesday. Tubby helped bring Silo the 2024 slowpitch state title, and her time as a Lady Rebel has her ready... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
